#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:212
msgid "Covariance Tool"
msgstr "Kovariansverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:215
msgid "Covariance Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för kovariansverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:217
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"covariance analysis dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" kovariansanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:230
msgid ""
"The covariance tool calculates the pairwise covariance coefficients of the "
"given variables. Use this tool to calculate any number of covariance "
"coefficients at the same time. The variables for which the covariances are "
"calculated are specified by the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The input range can consist of either a "
"single range or a comma separated list of ranges. The given range or ranges "
"can be grouped by columns, by rows, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Kovariansverktyget beräknar kovarianskoefficienterna för alla par av angivna"
" variabler. Med verktyget kan du beräkna flera koefficienter samtidigt. Ange"
" variablerna i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. "
"Indataområdet kan bestå av ett cellområde eller en kommaseparerad lista med "
"cellområden. Områdena kan grupperas efter kolumner, rader eller cellområden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:247
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"example data for a covariance analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata "
"för kovariansanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:261
msgid "Using The Covariance Tool"
msgstr "Använda kovariansverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:262
msgid ""
"For example, you want to calculate the covariance between three variables, "
"one each in columns A, B, and C. Both variables have 10 values in rows 2 to "
"11 with labels in row 1 (see <xref linkend=\"covariance-example-1\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Säg att du vill beräkna kovariansen mellan tre variabler, en i vardera "
"kolumn A, B och C. Varje variabel har tio värden i raderna 2–11 och en "
"rubrik i rad 1 (se <xref linkend=\"covariance-example-1\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:276
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains labels."
msgstr ""
"Välj alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom "
"den första raden innehåller rubriker."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:283
msgid ""
"The calculated covariances are given in a table with each column and row "
"labeled with the names of the variables. If the names are not given in the "
"input range, <application>Gnumeric</application> generates them. In our "
"example, the covariance between the variables in column A and B, can be "
"found in the second column and third row of the results table (see <xref "
"linkend=\"covariance-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"De beräknade kovarianserna visas i en tabell med variabelnamnen som rubriker"
" för rader och kolumner. Om variabelnamnen saknas i indataområdet skapar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> dem. I exemplet finns kovariansen mellan"
" variablerna i kolumn A och B i resultatets andra kolumn och tredje rad (se "
"<xref linkend=\"covariance-example-2\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:292
msgid "Covariance Tool Output"
msgstr "Kovariansverktygets utdata"

